				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": "tCQ_xAuoVXCYcHEcI",
			"name": "IQ",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A sorcerer's mind is his weapon.\n\nDesign: IQ 14 (+3 over the Legionary's 11), 20 pts/level (B15).",
