		{
			"id": "t795pY8ldEqrczs5z",
			"name": "Will",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The framework sets Will 16 against the 17 that IQ 14 would give: the warp has scoured something out.\n\nDesign: Will -1 (B16, 5/level), -5 points, for Will 16.",
			"tags": [
				"Attribute"
			],
			"base_points": -5,
			"features": [
