		{
			"id": "eBfc5_tXLsi0byv7v",
			"description": "Force Staff, Astartes Pattern",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The Librarian's staff of office: a tall, gauntlet-sized psychic focus shown in Codex Space Marines background and Black Library Space Marine fiction in the hands of Librarians and Epistolaries, doubling as a power weapon.\n\nDesign: The human Force Staff's formulas unchanged (sw+3d+2(10) cr and thr+3d+2(10) cr): a Marine's own ST 30 (sw 5d+2, thr 3d) supplies the extra dice, so the swing is 8d+4(10), average 32, and the thrust 6d+2(10), average 23. Swing penetrates Terminator plate (eff. DR 20) 99.3% of the time. Handling: heavier housing at Astartes scale, 9 lb and min ST 14, a two-handed reach weapon lighter than the Astartes Nemesis Force Halberd (14 lb, ST 14) and the Astartes power axe (13 lb, ST 18) because a staff is a psychic focus first. Staff parry 0 with no U as the human pattern.",
